// Library.SQLState.ailang — engine state, node kinds, and the bump arena.
//
// One statement resets the arena. Catalog rows live on the system heap.
// The AST is a type-tagged record (kind + flags + eight slots), the same
// idea as a plex node, with a capacity that survives multi-million-query runs.
//
// Copyright (c) 2026 Sean Collins, 2 Paws Machine and Engineering. SCSL.

LibraryImport.Arena
LibraryImport.Array
LibraryImport.Hash

